    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so if the arguments against it are basically just emotional... does that mean the \"pro-density\" side is basically the only rational way to handle the crisis? like, if you're looking at the actual data for housing shortages, isn't upzoning just the objectively correct solution?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
